title: "computation-suite: fea_engine and rom_engine"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Kumar"
    given-names: "Abhijeet"
version: "fea_engine 1.0.1, rom_engine 0.2.0"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/abhi2k16/fea-rom-computation-suite"
abstract: >-
  Two MIT-licensed Python packages for structural finite element analysis (fea_engine)
  and reduced-order modelling (rom_engine), depending only on NumPy and SciPy, with an
  optional PyTorch backend.
keywords:
  - finite element method
  - model order reduction
  - structural mechanics
  - Python
